            "scc_fuel_prefix_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The SCC prefixes `nonroad.f` reads an engine's fuel off (moves.rs `driver::fuel_for_scc`): four digits for the land-based families, seven for the marine and rail ones that share a family with another fuel. No two overlap. Float64, because it meets an SCC (`point_SCC`) in the same operator.",
