        "fk_soxBase": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "engine_fuel_kind_rows"
          ],
          "description": "`SWTGS2`, `SWTGS4`, `SWTDSL`, `SWTLPG`, `SWTCNG` (`nonrdprm.inc`): the sulfur weight percent NONROAD's emission factors were measured at. The SOx factor is written at it and the in-use sulfur corrects away from it."
